// --------------------------------------

// This table shows different easing functions and their output values
// for inputs from 0 to 10. Each column represents a different easing
// function type:
//
// - linear: Direct linear interpolation
// - ease: Standard easing curve
// - ease_in: Slow start, fast end
// - ease_out: Fast start, slow end  
// - progressive: Accelerating progression
// - exponential: Exponential growth
// - fibonacci: Based on fibonacci sequence ratios 